		<string text="Aim by turning a controller that has a gyroscope, and the right stick as a flick stick."/>
		<string text="Flying vehicles pitch as aircraft do: pushing up flies down."/>
		<string text="Levels the view while you walk."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Which of the controller's buttons does what. Button Remapping sets them one by one; the keyboard's keys are Key Bindings'."/>
		<string text="Which stick moves and which looks. Southpaw swaps them."/>
		<string text="Put any action on any button, each player their own layout, the D-pad and Back too: chat, push to talk, the scoreboard, a screenshot."/>
		<string text="How far each stick moves before it does anything: more for a worn stick that drifts, less for finer aim."/>
